## Narrative Position

Narrative: Chain Abstraction
Status: Main Narrative (HIGH) [NEAR Blog NEARCon 2023, https://near.org/blog/nearcon-2023] [NEAR Blog, https://near.org/blog] [NEARCore GitHub, https://github.com/near/nearcore]
